From 181016ef566ed6790da2d68eea7db0cfe82f7d91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arzaki Zunior Putra <zeeks@zekslab.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:47:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Remove upstream donation flow and point fork identity at
 Zekai

- Remove the donation campaign dialog, the Support Us entry, and
  the SupportUsScreen, so the fork never asks users to donate to
  the upstream project. Drop the unused donation preference and
  donation/Discord URL constants.
- About screen links only to this repository; the upstream
  privacy-policy link and social links are removed.
- Update checker now looks at zeeks024/zekai releases.
- Telemetry defaults to off: Zekai has no Firebase project, so
  no analytics or crash data can be sent to the upstream project.
  Remove the upstream google-services.json.
- Rewrite README and CONTRIBUTING for the fork, replace the
  repository logo with the Zekai icon, and point the code of
  conduct reporting route at the issue tracker.
